  "releaseNotes": "fix: the no-pi pick chain dropped `vertexPickEffect`, leaving `ViewSpaceNormal`/`PickViewPosition` as required vertex attributes that no producer supplied — the pick draw silently failed (no PickId written), breaking picking for any RenderObject whose user effect doesn't output `PickPartIndex`. Added `pickVertexNoPi` (no `pi` output, no `pvp` either since the no-pi path never feeds `pickEffectWithRealPosition`) and prepend its effect to the with-normal no-pi chain. The no-normal no-pi chain stays unchanged (vn is unused there and DCE drops it).",
